# .gitignore lists files and folders that Git should NOT track or upload.
# Each line is a pattern; lines starting with # are comments.

# Generated diagnostic output. Every run writes here:
#   *.txt  - report (transcript of the screen output)
#   *.log  - detailed timestamped log of every check, command and change
#   *.json - backups made by -Fix (needed by -RestoreFrom to undo changes)
#   *.etl  - raw USB traces made by -Trace (can be several MB)
# These contain machine-specific details (user name, computer name, hardware and
# device IDs), so they are kept out of the repository for privacy.
reports/

# Local VS Code AI assistant rules (personal editor setup, not part of the project)
.github\instructions\codacy.instructions.md
